      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Phenol undergoes many types of reaction, because both its electron-rich benzene ring and its polar -OH group can react. Reactions of the -OH group are described in topic 22.6.1 and reactions of the ring in topic 22.6.2."
